{"unit_id":"dialling__dsh-galaxy-view#card-zh","repo":"dialling/dsh-galaxy-view","commit":"d7330284e2d36c381c4ac35c9296de68458da780","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-galaxy-view 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的三维工作区与会话图谱插件。它在主界面提供银河面板和会话标题栏入口，把工作区、对话及其归属与派生关系绘成可交互星图。用户可以切换八种布局与主题、筛选和搜索会话、查看归档内容，并在星体间跃迁；另有记忆库视图，可浏览指令文件、技能及调用记录并编辑文件。适合希望直观浏览 DSH 会话和本地智能体记忆的用户；运行要求 DSH 兼容版本，无额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:9822-9852","lib/index.js:324-455","src/settings.js:43-54"]}
{"unit_id":"dialling__dsh-galaxy-view#card-en","repo":"dialling/dsh-galaxy-view","commit":"d7330284e2d36c381c4ac35c9296de68458da780","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-galaxy-view maps DSH workspaces and conversations as a 3D galaxy. Its panel offers multiple layouts, search and filters, plus a memory view of local instructions, skills, and skill calls. Users can read and edit files. It targets the DSH web client and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:9822-9852","lib/index.js:324-455","src/settings.js:43-54"]}
