{"unit_id":"dialling__dsh-galaxy-view#caveat-1","repo":"dialling/dsh-galaxy-view","commit":"d7330284e2d36c381c4ac35c9296de68458da780","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-galaxy-view 的记忆库会从本机 DSH 与工作区目录读取指令、技能文件和会话日志中的技能调用；编辑器保存时会通过宿主 RPC 写回所选文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:344-407","lib/index.js:449-484","lib/index.js:487-535"]}
